<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>someone else</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">kimmyt</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">someone else</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2DiK34dj8u3hzgO6WqIl0h</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.167" end="00:20.601">Woah-oh-oh woah-oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.601" end="00:24.054">Don′t fall in love with someone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.054" end="00:25.554" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.459" end="00:28.500">I hope you been well</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.500" end="00:32.194">Seems like it's been a long time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.194" end="00:36.530">Since I texted you like this oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.530" end="00:38.030" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.477" end="00:40.546">I been thinkin′ 'bout you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.546" end="00:43.384">Never a moment I'd doubt you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.384" end="00:49.201">But honestly it′s been a long time since you last left</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.201" end="00:50.701" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.506" end="00:55.461">I want the world to just stop spinnin′</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.461" end="00:58.425">Want you to listen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.425" end="01:00.930">I gotta say this now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.930" end="01:02.430" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.519" end="01:07.431">It's hard to move on if you think you′re still in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.431" end="01:13.452">But it hurts my heart to see you with another girl I guess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.452" end="01:17.950">I promise I'm not trynna be hurt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.950" end="01:20.530">But please baby please</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.530" end="01:24.458">Don′t fall in love with someone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.458" end="01:25.958" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.672" end="01:33.672">Woah-oh-oh woah woah woah woah woah-oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.584" end="01:44.541">Woah-oh-oh woah-oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.541" end="01:49.203">Don't fall in love with someone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.203" end="01:50.703" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.646" end="01:55.059" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Don′t fall in love in love with someone else)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.059" end="02:00.905" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Don't fall in love in love with someone else)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.905" end="02:02.405" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.490" end="02:04.545">Last night I tried not to call you up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.545" end="02:07.551">I guess I missed your voice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.551" end="02:10.101">The sound of it the memories</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.101" end="02:12.929">Like the way we were before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.929" end="02:14.429" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.518" end="02:19.549">You seem so distant now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.549" end="02:23.537">Sometimes I wonder how we didn't go through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.537" end="02:26.903">With the ideas I made with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.903" end="02:31.083">Maybe we were fallin′ out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.083" end="02:37.536">Before we tried to talk it out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.536" end="02:39.036" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.793" end="02:43.313">It′s hard to move on if you think you're still in love (Still in love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.313" end="02:49.449">But it hurts my heart to see you with another girl I guess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.449" end="02:53.932">I promise I′m not trynna be hurt (Not trynna be hurt)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.932" end="02:56.505">But please baby please</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.505" end="03:01.566">Don't fall in love with someone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.566" end="03:03.066" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.372" end="03:10.372">Woah-oh-oh woah woah woah woah woah-oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.441" end="03:20.516">Woah-oh-oh woah-oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.516" end="03:26.892">Don′t fall in love with someone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:26.892" end="03:30.892" /></div></body></tt>